    {
      "source": "Import selector to import the appropriate configuration class depending on whether Spring HATEOAS is present on the\nclasspath. We need to register the HATEOAS specific class first as apparently only the first class implementing\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/config/annotation/WebMvcConfigurationSupport.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport</code></a> gets callbacks invoked (see\nhttps://jira.springsource.org/browse/SPR-10565).",
      "translation": "导入选择器，以便根据 Spring HATEOAS 是否存在于类路径中导入相应的配置类。我们需要首先注册特定于 HATEOAS 的类，因为显然只有第一个实现<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/config/annotation/WebMvcConfigurationSupport.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport</code></a>的类会触发回调（参见 https://jira.springsource.org/browse/SPR-10565）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ResourceLoaderAware.html#setResourceLoader(org.springframework.core.io.ResourceLoader)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\">setResourceLoader</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ResourceLoaderAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\">ResourceLoaderAware</a></code>",
